	// the top layer of length 1, which contains the single root element.
	//        [Root]      -> Top layer has length 1.
	//    [E]       [F]   -> This layer has length 2.
	// [A]  [B]  [C]  [D] -> The bottom layer has length 4 (needs to be a power of two).
